            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Compounds of formula (I):wherein,R&lt;1>, R&lt;2>, R&lt;3>, R&lt;4a>, R&lt;4b> and R&lt;5> are described herein, or a stereoisomer, enantiomer or tautomer thereof or mixtures thereof, or a pharmaceutically acceptable salt or solvate thereof, are described herein, as well as other compounds. These compounds are useful in treating inflammation and/or pain. Compositions comprising a compound of the invention are also disclosed, as are methods of using the compounds to treat inflammation and/or pain.</p>
